<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <!--
    Better Traders Guild - Swap Platform Cannons GenStep (Vanilla Gravship Expanded 2)

    When Vanilla Gravship Expanded - Chapter 2 is active, two of the four inert vanilla
    GaussCannons the platform step spawns at the platform corners become VGE2's live
    VGE_EnemyGaussCannon, owned by the map's faction, so BTG's platforms defend
    themselves the way VGE2's own Traders Guild station does. The other two corners
    keep the vanilla cannon; the count is below VGE2's station average on purpose,
    since each destroyed cannon has a chance of leaving a gravcore.

    What the live cannon does (VGE code, not ours): it only ever targets things on the
    player's gravship substructure, never pawns on foot; it is stunned for a while when
    the player lands with a signal jammer off cooldown; it fires a discovery letter when
    unfogged. The MayRequire on the def keeps the VGE_EnemyGaussCannon reference from
    loading without VGE2; the pipelines list this step with the same MayRequire.

    Same footprint as GaussCannon (9x9) is required: the platform step sizes the terrain
    pads from the cannon def it spawned.
  -->

  <GenStepDef MayRequire="vanillaexpanded.gravship2">
    <defName>BTG_SwapPlatformCannons_VGE2</defName>
    <order>205</order>
    <genStep Class="BetterTradersGuild.MapGeneration.GenStep_SwapPlatformCannons">
      <fromDef>GaussCannon</fromDef>
      <toDef>VGE_EnemyGaussCannon</toDef>
      <count>2</count>
    </genStep>
  </GenStepDef>
</Defs>
